# Troubleshooting Scenario

### Problem

A user receives:

```text
Permission denied
```

### Investigation

First check:

```bash
ls -ld /opt/dev-project
```

Then check the user's groups:

```bash
id <username>
```

Then verify ownership and permissions:

```bash
ls -l /opt/dev-project
```

If the user was recently added to a group, the user's existing login session may not yet reflect the new supplementary group membership. Logging out and back in, or starting a new session, may be required.

